{"id":"number_port_no_list","category":"数字/端口不分条","input":"这个服务在 127.0.0.1:8793 上，等 3 秒再检查。","assert":{"shouldList":false,"containsAll":["127.0.0.1:8793","3 秒"],"forbiddenRegex":["(?m)^\\s*\\d+[\\.、．]"]}}
